@startuml PatientAdmin_State
title Patient Administration - State Machine

' Source of truth:
'   Product/main.c        - top-level loop, connection state, menu dispatch
'   Product/menu.c        - displayMenu / getMenuChoice
'   Product/CentralAcquisitionProxy.c - connect / disconnect / selectExaminationType
'   Shared/doseAdmin.c    - patient hash table
'
' The Patient Admin host program has two independent state variables.
' We render each as its own state machine to keep transition scopes clean:
'   1. Menu / interaction loop (the main flow driven by getMenuChoice())
'   2. Central-Acquisition connection state (toggled by connect/disconnect)

' =============================================================
' 1) MENU / INTERACTION LOOP
' =============================================================

[*] --> Startup
Startup : initHashTable()
Startup : connectWithCentralAcquisition()
Startup --> MainMenu

MainMenu : displayMenu()\ngetMenuChoice()

state ViewTable      : printTable()
state AddPatient     : scanf(name)\naddPatient()
state SelectPatient  : scanf(name)\nselectPatient()\non success: managePatient()
state DeletePatient  : scanf(name)\nremovePatient()
state SelectExamType : connectionState = CONNECTED\nscanf(0-4)\nselectExaminationType()\nwrites "$EXAM:n#" to Serial

MainMenu --> ViewTable      : MO_VIEW_TABLE
MainMenu --> AddPatient     : MO_ADD_PATIENT
MainMenu --> SelectPatient  : MO_SELECT_PATIENT
MainMenu --> DeletePatient  : MO_DELETE_PATIENT
MainMenu --> SelectExamType : MO_SELECT_EXAMINATION_TYPE\n[if: CONNECTED]
MainMenu --> Shutdown       : MO_QUIT

ViewTable      --> MainMenu
AddPatient     --> MainMenu : done / cancel if name == "0"
SelectPatient  --> MainMenu : done / cancel if not found
DeletePatient  --> MainMenu : done / cancel if input == "0"
SelectExamType --> MainMenu : done / cancel if not connected

Shutdown : if CONNECTED:\n          disconnectFromCentralAcquisition()
Shutdown : return 0
Shutdown --> [*]



' =============================================================
' 2) CENTRAL ACQUISITION CONNECTION (independent variable)
' =============================================================

state "Central Acquisition Connection" as CONN {
  [*] --> NotConnected
  NotConnected : connectionState =\nNOT_CONNECTED_WITH_CENTRAL_ACQUISITION
  Connected    : connectionState =\nCONNECTED_WITH_CENTRAL_ACQUISITION

  NotConnected --> Connected    : connectWithCentralAcquisition() = true\n(send $CONNECT#, recv $CONNECT#)
  Connected    --> NotConnected : disconnectFromCentralAcquisition()\n(send $DISCONNECT#, recv $DISCONNECT#)
}

note right of CONN
Both handshakes are blocking and
retry up to 10 times

The Connection variable
is used in a check in
MO_SELECT_EXAMINATION_TYPE 
and in MO_QUIT.
end note

@enduml
